    "summary": "Core Rules errata to the **[Desperate Escape Test](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape-2)** section. When an ability or **stratagem** tells a unit to take a Desperate Escape test, the unit:\n\n- must make any **fall-back move** in desperate escape mode\n- makes 1 **hazard roll** per model\n- makes 1 **battle-shock roll**",
